{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB娛樂訪談節目《一周星星》，今晚（25日）一集請來《璀璨之城》團隊，張智霖（Chilam）、吳卓羲（Ron）、高海寧（高Ling）、張曦雯（Kelly）、江美儀擔任嘉賓，接受主持區永權訪問，大談拍攝期間爆笑與崩潰時刻，更爆出多段鏡頭後不為人知的秘密。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.895796+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:18:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:05.454867+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798660+00:00","content_hash":"da8080d390e67b53a06ca0df15b6de30501ae3f105293c2a142d428e848ed4bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}